  ('consider_selling_follow_up', 'lc-v3am-csf-zh-1', 'consider_selling_follow_up — Mandarin (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Mandarin', '想再确认一下：如果价格合适，您愿意看看报价吗？', 'Just checking in: if the numbers made sense, would you look at a proposal?', 'S2', 'Stage 2 Consider Selling Follow-Up', true, 'missing_language'),
