  ('consider_selling_follow_up', 'lc-v3am-csf-ru-1', 'consider_selling_follow_up — Russian (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Russian', 'Просто уточню: если цифры вас устроят, рассмотрите предложение?', 'Just checking in: if the numbers made sense, would you look at a proposal?', 'S2', 'Stage 2 Consider Selling Follow-Up', true, 'missing_language'),
