  ('price_high_condition_probe', 'lc-v3am-phc-pl-1', 'price_high_condition_probe — Polish (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Polish', 'Rozumiem. Nieruchomość jest odnowiona, czy wymaga remontu?', 'Got it. Is the property updated, or does it need work?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition (near value)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('price_high_condition_probe', 'lc-v3am-phc-vi-1', 'price_high_condition_probe — Vietnamese (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Vietnamese', 'Tôi hiểu rồi. Căn nhà đã được sửa sang chưa, hay còn cần sửa chữa?', 'Got it. Is the property updated, or does it need work?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition (near value)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('price_high_condition_probe', 'lc-v3am-phc-zh-1', 'price_high_condition_probe — Mandarin (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Mandarin', '明白了。房子是翻新过的，还是需要修整？', 'Got it. Is the property updated, or does it need work?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition (near value)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('price_high_condition_probe', 'lc-v3am-phc-ko-1', 'price_high_condition_probe — Korean (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Korean', '알겠습니다. 집이 수리가 된 상태인가요, 아니면 손볼 곳이 있나요?', 'Got it. Is the property updated, or does it need work?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition (near value)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('price_high_condition_probe', 'lc-v3am-phc-he-1', 'price_high_condition_probe — Hebrew (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Hebrew', 'הבנתי. הנכס משופץ, או שהוא צריך עבודה?', 'Got it. Is the property updated, or does it need work?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition (near value)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-pt-1', 'repair_clarification — Portuguese (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Portuguese', 'Entendi. Quando diz que precisa de obras, é mais coisa estética, como pintura e piso, ou itens maiores como telhado, ar-condicionado ou fundação?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-fr-1', 'repair_clarification — French (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'French', 'Compris. Quand vous dites qu''il y a des travaux, c''est surtout esthétique comme la peinture et les sols, ou de gros postes comme le toit, le chauffage/la clim ou les fondations ?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-de-1', 'repair_clarification — German (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'German', 'Verstanden. Wenn Sie sagen, es muss etwas gemacht werden: eher optisch wie Farbe und Böden, oder größere Dinge wie Dach, Heizung/Klima oder Fundament?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-it-1', 'repair_clarification — Italian (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Italian', 'Capito. Quando dice che servono lavori, si tratta più di cose estetiche come pittura e pavimenti, o di interventi grossi come tetto, climatizzazione o fondamenta?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-pl-1', 'repair_clarification — Polish (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Polish', 'Rozumiem. Gdy mówi Pan, że wymaga pracy, to bardziej kosmetyka, jak malowanie i podłogi, czy większe rzeczy, jak dach, ogrzewanie/klimatyzacja albo fundamenty?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-vi-1', 'repair_clarification — Vietnamese (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Vietnamese', 'Tôi hiểu. Khi anh/chị nói nhà cần sửa, đó chủ yếu là sơn sửa, sàn nhà, hay là những hạng mục lớn như mái, điều hòa hoặc móng?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-zh-1', 'repair_clarification — Mandarin (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Mandarin', '明白。您说需要修整，主要是刷漆、地板这类表面工作，还是屋顶、空调暖气或地基这样的大项目？', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-ko-1', 'repair_clarification — Korean (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Korean', '알겠습니다. 손볼 곳이 있다고 하셨는데, 페인트나 바닥 같은 외관 위주인가요, 아니면 지붕, 냉난방, 기초 같은 큰 공사인가요?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-ja-1', 'repair_clarification — Japanese (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Japanese', '承知しました。手直しが必要とのことですが、塗装や床など見た目の部分が中心ですか？それとも屋根、空調、基礎などの大きな工事ですか？', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-he-1', 'repair_clarification — Hebrew (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Hebrew', 'הבנתי. כשאתה אומר שהוא צריך עבודה, זה בעיקר קוסמטי כמו צבע וריצוף, או דברים גדולים כמו גג, מיזוג או יסודות?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-ar-1', 'repair_clarification — Arabic (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Arabic', 'فهمت. عندما تقول إنه يحتاج إلى عمل، هل هو في الغالب تجميلي مثل الدهان والأرضيات، أم أمور أكبر مثل السقف أو التكييف أو الأساسات؟', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-ru-1', 'repair_clarification — Russian (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Russian', 'Понял. Когда вы говорите, что нужен ремонт, это в основном косметика, вроде покраски и полов, или что-то крупное, например крыша, отопление/кондиционер или фундамент?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-el-1', 'repair_clarification — Greek (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Greek', 'Κατάλαβα. Όταν λέτε ότι θέλει δουλειά, είναι κυρίως αισθητικά, όπως βάψιμο και δάπεδα, ή μεγαλύτερα, όπως στέγη, κλιματισμός ή θεμέλια;', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('repair_clarification', 'lc-v3am-rc-hi-1', 'repair_clarification — Indian (Hindi or Other) (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Indian (Hindi or Other)', 'समझ गया। जब आप कहते हैं कि काम चाहिए, तो क्या यह ज़्यादातर पेंट और फ़र्श जैसा ऊपरी काम है, या छत, एसी/हीटिंग या नींव जैसे बड़े काम?', 'Understood. When you say it needs work, is that mostly cosmetic like paint and flooring, or bigger items like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Major Repairs', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_asking_price', 'lc-v3am-sap-pt-1', 'seller_asking_price — Portuguese (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Portuguese', 'Entendi. Que preço você tem em mente para o imóvel?', 'Got it. What price would you have in mind for the property?', 'S3', 'Stage 3 Asking Price', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_asking_price', 'lc-v3am-sap-fr-1', 'seller_asking_price — French (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'French', 'Compris. Quel prix auriez-vous en tête pour le bien ?', 'Got it. What price would you have in mind for the property?', 'S3', 'Stage 3 Asking Price', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_asking_price', 'lc-v3am-sap-de-1', 'seller_asking_price — German (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'German', 'Verstanden. Welchen Preis hätten Sie für die Immobilie im Kopf?', 'Got it. What price would you have in mind for the property?', 'S3', 'Stage 3 Asking Price', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_asking_price', 'lc-v3am-sap-it-1', 'seller_asking_price — Italian (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Italian', 'Capito. Che prezzo avrebbe in mente per l''immobile?', 'Got it. What price would you have in mind for the property?', 'S3', 'Stage 3 Asking Price', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_asking_price', 'lc-v3am-sap-pl-1', 'seller_asking_price — Polish (seller conversation v3, acquisition os)', 'Polish', 'Rozumiem. Jaką cenę ma Pan na myśli za nieruchomość?', 'Got it. What price would you have in mind for the property?', 'S3', 'Stage 3 Asking Price', true, 'missing_language')
) as v(use_case, template_id, template_name, language, template_body, english_translation, stage_code, stage_label, native_review, kind)
